OL,3,GNEWSASeventh man arrested over huge    
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump                     
OL,6,FA seventh man has been arrested in     
OL,7,Fconnection with an enormous illegal    
OL,8,Fwaste dump in Oxfordshire.             
OL,10,FThe site in Kidlington was discovered  
OL,11,Fbetween the River Cherwell and the A34 
OL,12,Fin Oxfordshire last October and        
OL,13,Fcontained about 21,000 tonnes of waste.
OL,15,FOn Wednesday, the Environment Agency   
OL,16,F(EA) said a 35-year-old man from       
OL,17,FNortholt in Greater London had been    
OL,18,Farrested in connection with the dump.  
