OL,3,GNEWSASeventh man arrested over huge    
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump                     
OL,6,FIt takes the number of arrests in      
OL,7,Fconnection with the 150m (490ft) long  
OL,8,Fand 6m (20ft) high rubbish pile to     
OL,9,Fseven, after a further two arrests in  
OL,10,FSeptember.                             
